title = Your first contest
menu = Your first contest
menu.tip = From choosing the contest to submission and HAMLOG export
progress = {0} of {1} steps done
done = Done
step.1 = Choose the contest
step.1.text = In the zLog menu, choose the contest and create or open a log.
step.2 = Your station
step.2.text = Set your callsign, location and power in Options > Station.
step.3 = Logging
step.3.text = Type the callsign, Space to the number, Enter to log, Esc to clear. F1-F12 send messages.
step.4 = Check the score and dupes
step.4.text = Score is QSO points times multipliers. Dupes score nothing.
step.5 = Submit the log
step.5.text = Fill in the summary sheet in the submission window and save the E-Log.
step.6 = Export for HAMLOG
step.6.text = Export to HAMLOG with File > Export.
missing = Not available: this build does not include it
unavailable = Not available now
